Exu
$cards
DECK 4 {SPADES, CLUBS}

$initial
DRAW 58 DEAL DRISO
DRISO 2 FACE_LAST
DRISO 5 FACE_LAST
DRISO 8 FACE_LAST
DRISO 2 FACE_LAST
DRISO 7 FACE_LAST
DRISO 10 FACE_LAST
DRISO 3 FACE_LAST
DRISO 4 FACE_LAST
DRISO 4 FACE_LAST
DRISO 1 FACE_LAST

$moves
MOVE DRISO DRISO
OR
    AND
        DEST Suit {HEARTS, CLUBS, DIAMONDS}
        DEST Size > 9
    DEST Rank 1
MOVE_STACK DRISO DRISO
DEST Empty
$win
AND
    OR
        PILE ALL DRISO Empty
        PILE ALL DRISO Empty
    OR
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
        PILE ALL DRISO Empty
